abstract: >-
  Final analytical edition of a technical case study of the SolarWinds Orion
  software supply-chain compromise, covering the build compromise, SUNSPOT,
  SUNBURST, selective victim promotion, post-exploitation, identity and cloud
  activity, detection, remediation, ATT&CK mapping, trust-boundary attack-path
  reconstruction, detection hypotheses, Red Team research notes, and defensive
  lessons.
